<description>&lt;p&gt;Qatar’s intelligence chief says the country revamped its entire defence system in six hours, while Turkish troops will remain in Syria and Iraq until border security is ensured. Syrian security forces carried out operations that dismantled an ISIS mercenary cell and killed a member of the Defence Ministry in Eastern Ghouta, and a civilian was killed during an Israeli operation in Syria. The Syrian People’s Assembly is advancing a broad legislative overhaul covering employment, penal, property and national security law, and a British aid worker’s daughter continues searching for her father’s body after his death in Syria. 2,732 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/20/qatar-revamped-its-entire-defence-system-in-six-hours-intelligence-chief-reveals&quot;&gt;euronews.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFBlN0xVS3lMRTF6QzBnZTByS1o2ODIyTHc0UmRBbjV3M0ItRTJ4RjMzQlVjRno2bmhvSGxWUkRVV3BJR3VkMnBXRw?oc=5&quot;&gt;سانا&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxQZ0VlNXgtaGRQTkRrLVFiZTdzZ0hTeHpweGNfLXo5dmdlcFZsbkcwQU5OM0hiYllHTXQ2S3d4T3dtaDJrNEIwVGc1cVNXRmtYdUl6eFNOclFud3NWWDZ3Y3gyR2N5ZW1YbW92aVZNdTRrcW11cnpENUF6WVVWMzB6amhXWWVqVEhybXlnQjRKRU5NeFFaY0ljejBvYmNRYkNLNk82ZkUtdnBUZm4tdmlFVER3VmN6Nlk0SFZKSTRlQklUQVZBLUsw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxPd05lcmxlcjllVnNSMkFEdEtBVGVnVENnUkRkSU1iY01fZEZXc3I2N3RlaHJLMEtPWjV3NWJDeGh2aHItY1Q4R1JtWlNEUFd4SER1b2NTekdVcHdMaGlId0d4V3VQZzM2QUlBRVpaZDA3UzVidDNNZDM5ekppWVh4Zy1wWUNwTGJlVWRoTk81YXhJVm9UaW44UFQ1TXhJQ2M?oc=5&quot;&gt;ANHA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.